notes.notes:
In light of recent changes, we have reviewed your requests and made adjustments to improve your gaming experience:
[p align="start"]
[p align="start"]- Added notification about the end of doctrine transition;
[p align="start"]- When choosing to change the main doctrine, the maximum possible transition effects and effects in the first month are indicated;
[p align="start"]- Rebalanced the Tax Doctrine in a Planned Economy;
[p align="start"]- OS now become cheaper after the Americans develop them, rather than more expensive, as was previously the case;
[p align="start"]- Adopting doctrines through a vote by a collective body (parliament) has become cheaper;
[p align="start"]- Soviet democracy now requires low privileges;
[p align="start"]- Bug fixes;
[p align="start"]
[p align="start"]However, we are still working on a major update. Thank you for being with us! And don't forget to spread the word about our games among your friends, acquaintances, and various social groups. We love you!
